{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YehorBabenko88/Terminan/pulls/70","id":5201787825,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVD3iWM8AAAABNgz7sQ","html_url":"https://github.com/YehorBabenko88/Terminan/pull/70","diff_url":"https://github.com/YehorBabenko88/Terminan/pull/70.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/YehorBabenko88/Terminan/pull/70.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YehorBabenko88/Terminan/issues/70","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YehorBabenko88/Terminan/pulls/70/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YehorBabenko88/Terminan/pulls/70/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YehorBabenko88/Terminan/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YehorBabenko88/Terminan/issues/70/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YehorBabenko88/Terminan/statuses/c752dff751d964c57daf3b3afe4987ea3377839b","number":70,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add inert read-only Operations dashboard for local captured claims","user":{"login":"YehorBabenko88","id":304050327,"node_id":"U_kgDOEh9wlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/304050327?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88","html_url":"https://github.com/YehorBabenko88","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"There is no admitted operational collector or native channel for the new supervisor/mission/CI prototypes. This adds an inert LOCAL Operations dashboard that accepts explicitly TEST_ONLY or UNVERIFIED captured JSON and otherwise shows UNAVAILABLE. All operational axes stay UNKNOWN/UNAVAILABLE and all four action buttons are disabled without effect handlers.\n\nBase: feature/terminan-sync-v1-20261106 at 10e07ef108d155b9ca2278eec6a8361cb92fa488 / tree 899ab6ec331784aa4e512050c75665cecfa9385e. This stacked Draft changes exactly four newly reserved files; PR69 and the separate control-get/P0 work remain unchanged.\nHEAD: 30c2b2d89716592f30143130d862768037e888a5\nTree: 6666ed61aba07fbf2448b8984a0270d9dba4f1a3\n\nPublic API is only parseLocalProjection(text) and renderOperations(root,text). The bounded parser rejects decoded duplicate keys, unsupported schemas/fields, unsafe numeric tokens and overlimit inputs; returned models are frozen. The renderer uses textContent, no links/IO/timers/providers/controllers and no prior-data fallback after an invalid capture. Development physical PASS, journal AUTHORIZED/COMPLETED/chain PASS and reported CI SUCCESS cannot become operational health or authority. Protected CI authorization stays CONSUMED; ordinary runs are NOT_APPLICABLE. No DevTask→NodeOp conversion occurs.\n\nRoot-approved local DTO/extraction boundaries are documented with exact producer pins: supervisor b6f58f4, mission d226777, CI 48e38a2 and inactive deployment 4cfdc31. These are development/plan references, not installed or native facts. No C3 wire, backend endpoint, authentication or shared producer contract is added.\n\nValidation:\n- Initial 18-scenario RED→GREEN; independent review identified three identity issues. Added explicit regressions: RED 18 pass/3 fail, then GREEN 21 pass/zero skip.\n- Fresh raw checkout: source-bound mandatory 21 tests PASS, all 339 tracked files equal immutable Git blobs before/after; repeated after negative fixtures were restored.\n- Ten disposable source-guard negative cases refused before zero test execution: primary/raw shadows, ignored untracked executable, replacement ref, wrong HEAD, missing no-addons and ambient Node configuration. Guard qualification is isolated software evidence, not hostile OS/native attestation.\n- Actual isolated loopback Chromium stand: missing/TEST_ONLY/hostile inputs, five UNKNOWN axes, four disabled actions, no injected links/images or external requests, mobile no page overflow; three screenshots. Node DOM tests are model-only; browser evidence remains separate.\n- Independent final reviewer: no remaining actionable findings at exact HEAD; independently 21 tests PASS/zero skip.\n\nNew workflow pins actions and Node 22.14.0, Windows/Ubuntu, builtin Node only/no npm/dependencies. It bootstraps the runner from primary Git bytes, rejects ambient Node configuration/addons, enforces exact 21 scenario IDs/counts and full before/after raw inventory. Hosted results for this HEAD are pending; local Node 24.22.1 results are not transferred to hosted Windows or Node 22.\n\nCollector/native/operational/Home/physical acceptance remains UNAVAILABLE/NOT_RUN. Existing P0 and overall NO-GO are unchanged. No main merge, deployment, office/service/provider/security action requested.\n\nContract: docs/operations/operations-dashboard-contract.md\nEvidence: A6 workspace outputs/terminan-sync-v1/operations-dashboard-v1/ (source receipts, RED/GREEN, guard negatives, TEST_ONLY screenshots).","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-07T12:52:54Z","updated_at":"2026-11-07T13:02:14Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"32bcfe4e6b4d19b5732fd9d0f36d748b6c75c7ce","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"YehorBabenko88:feature/terminan-operations-dashboard-20261107","ref":"feature/terminan-operations-dashboard-20261107","repo":{"id":1413341784,"node_id":"R_kg